                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I tried to like this game, but I just can't.  The game looks great and on paper it's something I should really enjoy, but I just feel like I'm constantly at odds with the controls.  Though I have less than an hour into it, I've booted it up several times trying to make it work for me, only to find myself frustrated and only partly due to the fact that it freezes on occassion.  It would seem that micro-management is a very big part of this game, but the controls just don't feel tight enough to support that.\n\nIt looks really good, even great, but I would have preferred less of that polish on the exterior and more work on the guts.  Like I said, I really want to like this game, so I probably haven't given up on it and I'll revise my review should my opinion change.",
